{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"runConcurrently","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"changes","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConcurrentChange","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule16ConcurrentChangeV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ConcurrentChange"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each change reads the world as it was before any of them ran, and writes only the types"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its access lists, so the result is the same as running them one after another in any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order. A change sees the components and resources other changes write as missing, so it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must declare everything it reads."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"c"}]},{"text":"·","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"t"}]},{"text":") besides the changes themselves, for ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"c","type":"text"}]},{"text":" changes and ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"t","type":"text"}]},{"text":" stored","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"component types.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note"},{"type":"aside","name":"Precondition","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No two accesses conflict. Each change writes only the component and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resource types its access lists, and spawns, despawns and changes the hierarchy not at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all; a change that writes another component type or changes the entities traps."}]}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V15runConcurrentlyyySayAA16ConcurrentChangeVGF","extendedModule":"WorldModule","title":"runConcurrently(_:)","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"runConcurrently"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule16ConcurrentChangeV","text":"ConcurrentChange"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Concurrency.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Concurrency.swift#L159"}},"abstract":[{"text":"Runs ","type":"text"},{"code":"changes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" at the same time, each on a copy of the world, and keeps what each wrote.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/runconcurrently(_:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/runConcurrently(_:)"},"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World":{"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Entities, the components they hold, and the world’s resources."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text